WEBVTT

00:30.660 --> 00:32.300
Can I do, do?

01:43.600 --> 01:48.370
The aformentioned Typhoon 10 is now fully formed and heading north.

01:48.370 --> 01:50.040
It will soon make landfall.

01:50.040 --> 01:54.810
Gale-force winds are expected to last
from tonight throughout tomorrow.

01:54.810 --> 01:59.380
This typhoon is the strongest one
to approach Japan this year.

01:59.380 --> 02:00.210
The pressure in the eye has been measured at 300 hPa.

02:00.220 --> 02:02.550
Oh, a stormy weekend.

02:02.550 --> 02:06.150
Wind speeds have been measured at 45 kph.

02:06.150 --> 02:09.820
Wind speeds of up to 25 kph have been recorded up to three hundred kilometers away from the eye.

02:09.830 --> 02:12.730
Oh? Ms. Hime is not at home?

02:12.730 --> 02:15.000
The NWS has called for a state of emergency.

02:15.000 --> 02:15.600
Well, well...

02:17.530 --> 02:21.810
I'll have to make sure she has a lovely weekend.

02:33.620 --> 02:36.320
The typhoon has strengthened upon making landfall.

02:36.320 --> 02:40.350
Gale-force winds are expected to last throughout the weekend.

02:40.360 --> 02:42.060
The wind has been clocked at top speeds of 45 kph...

02:42.060 --> 02:43.060
Damn!

02:43.060 --> 02:44.870
This sucks!

02:51.370 --> 02:53.510
I don't feel so good.

02:53.570 --> 02:56.000
I wouldn't call this fun.

02:56.000 --> 02:58.910
You're the one who said you
wanted to go for a drive!

02:58.910 --> 03:00.890
Eyes on the road! The road!

03:10.120 --> 03:12.150
Hey, Hiro!

03:12.150 --> 03:15.990
Why did you leave super-strong Flandre
home on today of all days?!

03:15.990 --> 03:19.630
Don't look at me! My sister took her with her!

03:20.130 --> 03:23.060
Oh, dear, would you look at all that rain?

03:23.070 --> 03:24.230
Huga.

03:24.230 --> 03:28.840
You come to help me with shopping,
but now this happens...

03:28.840 --> 03:30.480
Huga.

03:30.910 --> 03:32.670
May I take your order?

03:32.670 --> 03:35.180
A strawberry parfait, of course.

03:35.180 --> 03:36.780
Do you want anything, Flan?

03:36.780 --> 03:37.680
Huga.

03:37.680 --> 03:40.310
There have been reports of roads becoming impassible

03:40.320 --> 03:43.450
due to landslides in the mountain regions caused by the typhoon.

03:43.450 --> 03:47.660
Rescue efforts are underway, but they are greatly impeded by the bad weather conditions.

03:47.660 --> 03:48.960
Huga.

03:48.960 --> 03:50.660
Also, because of this...

04:02.700 --> 04:06.210
Well, looks like we're stranded.

04:06.210 --> 04:10.410
You know, I saw a motel down the road from here.

04:10.410 --> 04:12.250
Shall we take shelter there?

04:12.250 --> 04:14.230
Yeah, that's fine.

04:24.790 --> 04:26.500
Welcome.

04:27.330 --> 04:29.630
It's rough out there in the rain, huh?

04:29.630 --> 04:32.040
I'll bring you guys some towels.

04:33.570 --> 04:35.000
What's wrong?

04:35.000 --> 04:36.600
It stinks.

04:36.610 --> 04:39.350
I don't like the way it smells here.

04:42.810 --> 04:47.380
Actually, we're quite packed due
to the inclement weather.

04:47.380 --> 04:49.920
Would the three of you mind
sharing a single room?

04:49.920 --> 04:51.560
One!

04:51.790 --> 04:55.960
One room...

04:59.390 --> 05:01.200
R..Reiri!

05:01.200 --> 05:03.900
Packing three in a double room will be cramped.

05:03.900 --> 05:08.400
Come stay in my room.

05:08.400 --> 05:10.200
Why?

05:10.210 --> 05:13.780
For the same reason as you three, I'd imagine.

05:14.640 --> 05:17.890
Nice to see you again, Princess.

05:18.150 --> 05:20.520
You haven't changed, I see.

05:20.980 --> 05:23.320
You damn vampire-woman!

05:23.320 --> 05:26.120
I knew I smelled something nasty around here!

05:26.120 --> 05:29.190
Stop! No fighting here!

05:29.190 --> 05:30.830
Guests...

05:31.560 --> 05:33.930
Our main lobby area is located down that hallway.

05:33.930 --> 05:36.310
Please feel free to relax.

05:36.870 --> 05:41.610
Man, I was bummed about being
stranded due to the typhoon,

05:42.040 --> 05:46.270
but now that these cute girls have shown up,
it doesn't seem so bad.

05:46.270 --> 05:50.280
So, what kind of cosplay is that?

05:52.150 --> 05:55.420
No, I mean, forget that!

05:57.390 --> 06:01.420
Since we're all stranded here due
to the typhoon, let's try to get along.

06:01.420 --> 06:04.690
Yes! That's what I meant to say.

06:04.690 --> 06:07.930
I believe the saying is,
"bitter enemies in the same boat".

06:07.930 --> 06:12.500
Whoops, perhaps that's too complicated
for the uncivilized wolf-girl to grasp.

06:12.500 --> 06:15.140
I swear I'm going to kill you someday.

06:15.140 --> 06:18.170
Hey, what are you flirting with other girls for?

06:18.170 --> 06:20.350
Shut up and gimme a break, will ya?

06:30.150 --> 06:34.070
He collapsed as soon as he walked in here.

06:35.190 --> 06:37.890
L..Is he dead?

06:37.890 --> 06:39.960
You wouldn't have...

06:39.960 --> 06:44.310
If you don't believe me, check his neck.

06:48.200 --> 06:49.840
Umm...

06:50.610 --> 06:52.480
He's still breathing.

06:53.040 --> 06:54.680
Call an ambulance!

06:54.680 --> 06:56.420
R--Right!

07:00.150 --> 07:01.790
Huh?

07:03.420 --> 07:04.720
There's no dial tone.

07:04.720 --> 07:06.360
What?!

07:14.430 --> 07:16.960
I wonder if he's all right?

07:16.970 --> 07:18.770
Who knows.

07:21.570 --> 07:24.570
A doctor should see him as soon as possible.

07:24.570 --> 07:27.110
Obviously, but our cell phones are out of range.

07:27.110 --> 07:29.980
We're stuck until the roads are cleared.

07:29.980 --> 07:33.580
I was sure that vampire was the one who did it.

07:33.580 --> 07:35.380
Unfortunately, you were wrong.

07:35.380 --> 07:36.950
What the hell are you doing here?!

07:36.950 --> 07:41.090
I only like the blood of virgins and cute little boys.

07:41.320 --> 07:44.630
And I wouldn't dream of drinking blood
drawn from a beast.

07:44.630 --> 07:46.260
Whatever!

08:05.650 --> 08:07.750
Why did he fall?

08:07.750 --> 08:12.750
The man at the reception desk said
he just suddenly collapsed.

08:12.890 --> 08:14.700
It's obvious.

08:15.690 --> 08:20.430
There's probably something else here that's
sucking the life-force out of the humans.

08:20.430 --> 08:22.840
Something else? Who?!

08:27.240 --> 08:30.500
Ignore that, we're safer right where we are.

08:30.510 --> 08:32.950
He's already run off.

08:33.510 --> 08:35.420
Could it be here?

08:37.680 --> 08:40.420
Hey, . . Hey!

08:41.750 --> 08:44.920
She's showing the same symptoms
as the guest from before.

08:44.920 --> 08:46.690
N..No way...

08:46.690 --> 08:50.960
What's going on?
She was totally fine before.

08:50.960 --> 08:53.100
Could it be an airborne disease?

08:55.030 --> 08:56.870
That's not possible.

08:57.670 --> 09:00.200
Then what the hell is this?!

09:00.200 --> 09:02.340
Care to explain?!

09:03.100 --> 09:03.700
Stop, please!

09:05.270 --> 09:06.070
Let go of him!

09:07.880 --> 09:12.480
There's probably something else here that's
sucking the life-force out of the humans.

09:13.080 --> 09:13.580
I'm getting out of here.

09:13.580 --> 09:15.380
If what Hime said is true, then...

09:16.520 --> 09:18.190
Leave, see if I care!

09:18.190 --> 09:18.950
Who is behind this?

09:21.890 --> 09:22.990
It's fine!

09:22.990 --> 09:25.090
Fine? You insane or something?!

09:25.090 --> 09:26.160
Mom...

09:26.160 --> 09:30.400
Yuki! I told you not to leave the room.

09:30.400 --> 09:35.170
Before, there was this big thing
that looked like a spider.

09:35.170 --> 09:37.810
It was crawling all over.

09:37.810 --> 09:39.170
A spider?

09:39.170 --> 09:42.920
Yeah, it was this big!

09:47.780 --> 09:49.420
Please go back to your rooms.

09:49.420 --> 09:50.820
R..Right...

09:50.820 --> 09:53.290
Yeah, let's head back.

09:53.290 --> 09:55.360
Let's go, Yuki.

10:07.440 --> 10:09.350
A large spider...

10:12.540 --> 10:16.390
Could it be a monster?

10:17.850 --> 10:19.830
We've got trouble!

10:31.390 --> 10:33.600
So? What about it?

10:34.830 --> 10:36.630
It's your turn now, Princess.

10:36.630 --> 10:38.970
W..Wait a second, Hime!

10:38.970 --> 10:41.870
Two people were attacked already!
We can't just...

10:41.870 --> 10:44.640
We'll worry about it if it attacks us.

10:44.640 --> 10:46.780
Otherwise, it's not our problem

10:47.140 --> 10:48.950
That's cruel...

10:49.880 --> 10:52.290
You're a curious little one, aren't you?

10:52.610 --> 10:54.990
If you're really that bored,

10:55.880 --> 10:57.320
how about you come back to my room,

10:57.320 --> 11:00.520
and we try out some ways to have fun
without spending any money?

11:00.520 --> 11:04.730
Wha... What are you saying?!

11:07.360 --> 11:09.740
Oh, how cute, you're blushing!

11:12.370 --> 11:15.470
Hey, it's not time to feed you yet.

11:21.340 --> 11:24.320
I don't like just sitting around waiting.

11:24.980 --> 11:29.050
Let's go see what that spider thing's deal is.

11:31.250 --> 11:32.890
Okay!

11:33.090 --> 11:35.690
Let's go! Wake up the others!

11:35.690 --> 11:37.430
M..Me?

11:43.300 --> 11:45.870
Alone at last...

11:53.070 --> 11:55.320
My heart is racing

12:02.320 --> 12:05.920
You've got good taste for a vampire.

12:14.160 --> 12:18.040
Oh dear, did I fall asleep?

12:20.670 --> 12:25.070
Oh well, I can't make it home
in this weather anyway.

12:25.070 --> 12:26.780
Goodnight...

12:29.040 --> 12:31.350
Where did Flan go?

12:34.350 --> 12:37.060
Maybe she went home without me.

12:37.620 --> 12:40.730
Oh well, goodnight!

12:41.520 --> 12:43.330
Sweet dreams.

12:54.500 --> 12:58.410
Hey! Anything over there?

12:58.410 --> 13:00.570
No! Nothing!

13:00.580 --> 13:02.710
Man, we haven't found a thing.

13:03.210 --> 13:04.750
This is ridiculous.

13:04.750 --> 13:07.210
We're in a typhoon! Give it a rest.

13:07.220 --> 13:09.120
A large spider?

13:09.120 --> 13:11.450
You can't trust what a little kid said.

13:11.450 --> 13:13.650
Where do you get off?

13:13.660 --> 13:15.660
Your girlfriend is one of the victims!

13:15.660 --> 13:18.460
I don't even know that chick's name.

13:18.460 --> 13:20.270
I just picked her up downtown.

13:21.260 --> 13:24.100
You're an ass, you know that?

13:24.100 --> 13:25.370
What?!

13:25.370 --> 13:27.310
St..Stop that, guys!

13:32.470 --> 13:34.110
Honey...

13:34.680 --> 13:37.280
Tomako, what are you doing?

13:37.280 --> 13:39.550
I told you to stay with Yuki.

13:45.020 --> 13:48.990
Honey!

13:56.030 --> 13:58.410
What the hell is that?!

14:01.470 --> 14:03.110
So...

14:04.270 --> 14:06.480
So, it is a monster!

14:07.840 --> 14:09.640
Hiro! Capture it!

14:09.640 --> 14:11.280
What?!

14:18.120 --> 14:19.760
Wait!

14:26.660 --> 14:27.890
You idiot!

14:27.900 --> 14:29.730
L..I'm sorry.

14:29.730 --> 14:31.530
Tomako!

14:31.530 --> 14:33.230
Tomako! Tomako!

14:33.230 --> 14:35.570
Sh..She's the third victim.

14:35.570 --> 14:37.550
How can this be?

14:38.640 --> 14:42.540
So, it was a monster that did this.

14:42.540 --> 14:44.820
Maybe Hime can do something.

14:46.010 --> 14:47.510
I refuse.

14:47.520 --> 14:49.980
N..No way...

14:49.980 --> 14:51.590
Say, Princess...

14:51.590 --> 14:53.350
I'm not changing my mind.

14:53.350 --> 14:55.020
Just this once.

14:55.020 --> 14:56.020
Give it up.

14:56.020 --> 15:00.090
Hey! Do you really not care how many
humans that thing feeds on?!

15:00.090 --> 15:04.510
There are some monsters that need
to feed on humans to survive.

15:05.070 --> 15:08.840
It's just doing what it has to do to survive.

15:08.840 --> 15:11.540
Even children know of the laws of nature.

15:11.540 --> 15:15.180
In human society, you may see it
as an abominable atrocity,

15:15.640 --> 15:18.850
but that's got nothing to do with me.

15:22.420 --> 15:24.060
Fine...

15:24.290 --> 15:26.990
I won't ask you again.

15:29.320 --> 15:32.360
Are you okay with that, Princess?

15:32.360 --> 15:34.810
It's fine, let him be.

15:38.570 --> 15:40.170
Oh no...

15:40.170 --> 15:41.980
I win.

15:43.270 --> 15:45.380
You jumped the gun.

15:45.840 --> 15:48.680
I don't see a checkmate yet.

15:53.150 --> 15:54.820
Where...

15:55.680 --> 15:57.490
Where is it?

16:03.790 --> 16:06.360
Oh, it's just the wind.

16:07.360 --> 16:09.670
Come out, come out wherever you are.

16:16.240 --> 16:17.770
Stay back.

16:17.770 --> 16:20.010
There's a chance that there
will be more landslides.

16:26.510 --> 16:28.150
Huga.

16:30.180 --> 16:31.820
Damn!

16:32.250 --> 16:34.960
We let it get away.

16:34.960 --> 16:37.560
But now we know what's causing it.

16:37.560 --> 16:40.900
That monster goes from one person
to the next, possessing them.

16:41.260 --> 16:43.430
Wh..What should we do?

16:43.430 --> 16:46.740
Shall I contact the police?
Or maybe the Self Defense Force?

16:47.270 --> 16:50.740
What for? It's just an oversized spider.

16:51.410 --> 16:53.810
How can you be so calm?!

16:53.810 --> 16:55.650
That's no ordinary spider.

16:56.440 --> 16:58.110
Also...

16:58.110 --> 17:01.180
It may have already possessed its next victim!

17:11.260 --> 17:13.460
Scared, huh?

17:13.460 --> 17:16.160
Is that who you really are?!

17:16.160 --> 17:18.170
What's the matter with you,
you goddamn derelict?!

17:18.170 --> 17:19.670
What did you call me?!

17:19.670 --> 17:21.480
Hey, knock it off!

17:29.410 --> 17:31.150
H..Hey...

17:50.360 --> 17:52.530
Th..There it is!

17:52.530 --> 17:54.340
You damn monster!

18:01.010 --> 18:02.820
Move it!

18:31.140 --> 18:33.240
He swallowed it.

18:45.520 --> 18:46.520
Damn you!

18:46.520 --> 18:48.120
D..Don't hit him!

18:48.120 --> 18:50.460
He's just possessed by that thing!

18:50.460 --> 18:54.030
Are you just going let it kill us all?!

18:54.030 --> 18:55.910
B..But still...

19:04.840 --> 19:07.010
Hiro, stay back.

19:10.310 --> 19:12.010
I'll relieve him of his pain.

19:12.010 --> 19:15.760
Relieve him of his pain?
You don't mean...

19:41.010 --> 19:42.910
I had a hunch and I was right.

19:42.910 --> 19:44.040
It's It.

19:44.050 --> 19:45.450
It?

19:45.450 --> 19:48.920
Yes, It has no name.

19:48.920 --> 19:51.750
There is only one way to kill It.

19:51.750 --> 19:54.790
You need to completely and savagely destroy It.

19:55.020 --> 19:56.390
Reiri!

19:56.390 --> 19:58.790
I'll just add one thing.

19:58.790 --> 20:04.440
I don't typically pick up things that weigh
more than forks or knives.

20:09.140 --> 20:10.300
Wait!

20:10.300 --> 20:12.110
It's escaping!

20:14.140 --> 20:15.780
Huga.

20:22.680 --> 20:24.490
Well done,

20:25.020 --> 20:26.660
Flandre.

20:26.950 --> 20:28.590
Huga.

20:35.860 --> 20:37.960
What nice weather.

20:37.970 --> 20:39.570
Here you go.

20:39.570 --> 20:40.930
It's on the house.

20:40.940 --> 20:43.300
Oh, a morning parfait!

20:43.300 --> 20:45.110
Thank you, Master!

20:49.280 --> 20:51.910
I wonder if everyone's all right?

20:51.910 --> 20:54.880
There shouldn't be any problems
now that we killed It.

20:54.880 --> 20:57.050
So, people won't make a big deal about It?

20:57.050 --> 21:02.050
It will just turn into yet another dramatic
urban legend set on a stormy night.

21:02.120 --> 21:05.760
Give my regards to the one who
arranged this whole plot.

21:08.530 --> 21:10.200
Thank you for staying with us.

21:15.470 --> 21:19.440
I look forward to your next visit

21:19.440 --> 21:23.880
I can't speak for the Princess,
but I had a very fun night.

21:23.880 --> 21:27.110
I also had a lovely night thanks to Ms. Hime.

21:27.110 --> 21:31.250
But it was in somewhat poor taste
to use that thing.

21:31.250 --> 21:35.360
Oh, my, I'm disappointed that you
don't appreciate its value.

21:36.520 --> 21:39.870
So, how's a game of chess sound, Ms. Reiri?

21:40.630 --> 21:42.440
Fine by me.

21:43.030 --> 21:45.370
I won't lose to you.

21:51.040 --> 21:53.040
Say, Hime...

21:53.540 --> 21:56.180
Thanks for saving everyone.

23:41.620 --> 23:43.120
Huga.

23:43.120 --> 23:45.590
Hiro, my younger sister moved to town.

23:45.590 --> 23:48.390
Your younger sister?
You mean Princess Sherwood?

23:48.390 --> 23:50.020
Yes, go there, Hiro.

23:50.020 --> 23:51.090
Go where?

23:51.090 --> 23:53.560
To Sherwood's mansion, isn't it obvious?

23:53.560 --> 23:55.430
You're to congratulate her on the move.

23:55.430 --> 23:58.870
Geez, over the river and through the woods...

23:58.870 --> 23:59.870
Ah, found it!

23:59.870 --> 24:02.170
So, this is Princess Sherwood's new home.

24:02.170 --> 24:04.640
But what's that thing in the garden?

24:04.640 --> 24:06.870
Huh? What's a panda doing here?!

24:06.870 --> 24:07.910
Next episode, "Princess Black and White"

24:09.510 --> 24:10.780
Huga, huga.
